al":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.5.1.stable.official [f62fdbde1]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.1.stable - Manjaro Linux `#1` SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Thu, 18 Dec 2025 13:46:28 +0000 on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 7600 (RADV NAVI33) - AMD Ryzen 5 5600 6-Core Processor (12 threads) - 15.54 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nI tend to have a lot of scripts open which I routinely close by middle clicking them in the open scripts tab. Sometimes doing that will jump the navigation in the currently open script, which gets confusing.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open a bunch of scripts, activate one\n2. Set the cursor in the active script somewhere\n3. Close a bunch of scripts (not the active one)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[script-close-bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24422051/script-close-bug.zip)\n\nOpen the fifteen scripts `0-14.gd` and `main_long_script.gd`, close 0-14 and observe the bug","closed_by":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.git